You stand at the edge of a great clearing, between an immense building and a 
jungle which teems with wild and diverse forms of life. All seem to reverence
the building to the southeast. You can see no entrance to the building from 
where you stand, but the clearing opens further onto the south. The area
surrounding you is far less forboding here that elsewhere. The ground is 
somewhat more dry here, and the sky above seems brighter and more open.
